s","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.48,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"poisoning","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":1,"lift":1,"evidence_tier":"sparse"},{"concept_id":"sore_throat","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.76,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"urolithiasis","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.72,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"wounds","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":2,"lift":0.95,"evidence_tier":"sparse"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"cul:042-the-bramble-or-black-berry-bush":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: The Bramble, Or Black-Berry Bush","headword":"The Bramble, Or Black-Berry Bush","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"It is a plant of Venus in Aries. If any ask the reason why Venus is so prickly? Tell them it is because she is in the house of Mars. The buds, leaves, and branches, while they are green, are of a good use in the ulcers and putrid sores of the mouth and throat, and of the quinsey, and likewise to heal other fresh wounds and sores; but the flowers and fruit unripe are very binding, and so profitable for the bloody flux, lasks, and are a fit remedy for spitting of blood. Either the decoction of the powder or of the root taken, is good to break or drive forth gravel and the stone in the reins and kidneys. The leaves and brambles, as well green as dry, are exceeding good lotions for sores in the mouth, or secret parts. The decoction of them, and of the dried branches, do much bind the belly and are good for too much flowing of women’s courses; the berries of the flowers are a powerful remedy against the poison of the most venomous serpents; as well drank as outwardly applied, helps the sores of the fundament and the piles; the juice of the berries mixed with the juice of mulberries, do bind more effectually, and helps all fretting and eating sores and ulcers wheresoever. The distilled water of the branches, leaves, and flowers, or of the fruit, is very pleasant in taste, and very effectual in fevers and hot distempers of the body, head, eyes, and other parts, and for the purposes aforesaid. The leaves boiled in lye, and the head washed therewith, heals the itch and running sores thereof, and makes the hair black. The powder of the leaves strewed on cankers and running ulcers, wonderfully helps to heal them. Some use to condensate the juice of the leaves, and some the juice of the berries, to keep for their use all the year, for the purposes aforesaid.","spans":[{"start":212,"end":259,"concept_id":"sore_throat","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":272,"end":279,"concept_id":"sore_throat","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":314,"end":320,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":325,"end":330,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":409,"end":420,"concept_id":"dysentery","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":422,"end":427,"concept_id":"diarrhea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":454,"end":471,"concept_id":"hemoptysis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":562,"end":568,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":577,"end":582,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":590,"end":595,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":600,"end":607,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":687,"end":705,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":782,"end":796,"concept_id":"diarrhea","polarity":"action"},{"start":814,"end":849,"concept_id":"menorrhagia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":912,"end":918,"concept_id":"poisoning","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":931,"end":939,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":940,"end":948,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":996,"end":1001,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1027,"end":1032,"concept_id":"hemorrhoids","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1155,"end":1160,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1165,"end":1171,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1309,"end":1315,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1476,"end":1480,"concept_id":"itch_scabies","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1493,"end":1498,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1570,"end":1577,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1590,"end":1596,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"images":[]}